# The 7-Stage Berry Wilson Loop & Hyperplane Causal Transmutation Poset (`𝔚₁ ≺ 𝔚₂ ≺ ⋯ ≺ 𝔚₇`)

This canonical module formalizes the 7-stage acyclic causal poset governing
causal signature transmutation inside the noncommutative Peirce `(J, Φ)`
hyperplane via the Berry curvature Wilson loop (`Σ = [N₊, N₋] = J Φ = S_P V`),
reusing the repository's existing Peirce spine and Tetraktys owners:

1. **Stage `𝔚₁` (`W1_CausalHyperplaneAndOrthogonalOppositeSquares`)**:
   The causal `(J, Φ)` hyperplane generated by the off-diagonal nilpotent cones
   `N₊ = conePlus P A` (`N₊² = 0`) and `N₋ = coneMinus P C` (`N₋² = 0`):
   * Timelike current `J = N₊ - N₋` with `J² = -V`,
   * Spacelike solder bridge `Φ = N₊ + N₋` with `Φ² = +V`,
   * Opposite squares `J² + Φ² = 0` and exact hyperplane anticommutativity
     `{J, Φ} = J Φ + Φ J = 0`,
   * Universal hyperplane Pythagorean difference-of-squares law:
     `(c • J + s • Φ)² = (s² - c²) • V` and `(c • Φ + s • J)² = (c² - s²) • V`.
2. **Stage `𝔚₂` (`W2_BerryCurvatureHyperplaneBivectorGenerator`)**:
   Berry curvature `Σ = [N₊, N₋]` as the geometric bivector generator of the
   `(J, Φ)` hyperplane:
   * `Σ = J Φ = -Φ J`, `[J, Φ] = 2 Σ`, `Σ = S_P V = V S_P`,
   * Chiral anticommutation `{Σ, J} = 0`, `{Σ, Φ} = 0`, `{S_P, J} = 0`, `{S_P, Φ} = 0`,
   * Centrality of the metric modulus `V` on the hyperplane (`[V, J] = [V, Φ] = [V, Σ] = 0`),
   * Ordered 4-factor Peirce Wilson plaquette expansion (`WilsonPlaquette.lean`).
3. **Stage `𝔚₃` (`W3_DirectBerryBivectorSignatureTransmutation`)**:
   Direct bivector rotation of the timelike and spacelike generators by `Σ`:
   * `Σ J = +V Φ` and `Σ Φ = +V J`,
   * Signature inversion: `(Σ J)² = +V³` (spacelike!) and `(Σ Φ)² = -V³` (timelike!),
     with `(Σ J)² + (Σ Φ)² = 0`.
4. **Stage `𝔚₄` (`W4_InfinitesimalHolonomyCommutatorAndFluxHorizon`)**:
   Infinitesimal Berry holonomy commutator `[Σ, J] = 2 V Φ` and `[Σ, Φ] = 2 V J`:
   * Parallel-transported current `J(t) = J + t • (V Φ)` has causal square
     `J(t)² = -V + t² • V³ = V * (t² • V² - 1)`,
   * Crosses the null horizon when `t² • V² = 1`.
5. **Stage `𝔚₅` (`W5_UniversalPolynomialWilsonLoopHolonomy`)**:
   Universal even polynomial Wilson loop holonomy operator
   `W(c, s) = c • V + s • Σ` over any commutative scalar ring `R`:
   * `evenGrade P (W(c, s)) = W(c, s)` and `oddGrade P (W(c, s)) = 0`,
   * `W(c, s) * J = V * (c • J + s • Φ)` and `W(c, s) * Φ = V * (c • Φ + s • J)`,
   * Exact polynomial causal transmutation law:
     `(W(c, s) * J)² = (s² - c²) • V³` and `(W(c, s) * Φ)² = (c² - s²) • V³`.
6. **Stage `𝔚₆` (`W6_LightConeNilpotentHorizonAtCriticalFlux`)**:
   Exact light-cone nilpotent horizon at the critical Berry flux ratios `s = ±c`:
   * `W(1, 1) = 2 (N₊ N₋)` maps `J` to `+2 V N₊`, whose square is identically `0`,
   * `W(1, -1) = 2 (N₋ N₊)` maps `J` to `-2 V N₋`, whose square is identically `0`,
   * `W(0, 1) = Σ` maps `J` to `+V Φ`, whose square is `+V³`.
7. **Stage `𝔚₇` (`W7_TrigonometricBerryRotorAndExactWickTransmutation`)**:
   Trigonometric Berry rotor `R(θ) = cos θ • 1 + sin θ • S_P` over an `ℝ`-algebra:
   * Socratic Rung 0 anticommuting rotor sign flip:
     `J * R(θ) = R(-θ) * J` and `R(θ) * R(-θ) = cos(2θ) • 1`,
   * Hyperplane rotation: `J(θ) := R(θ) * J = cos θ • J + sin θ • Φ`,
   * Continuous Wick causal transmutation law:
     `J(θ)² = (-cos(2θ)) • V` and `Φ(θ)² = cos(2θ) • V`,
   * Exact three-phase transition:
     - `θ = 0`: `J(0) = J` and `J(0)² = -V` (Timelike),
     - `θ = π/4`: `J(π/4) = √2 • N₊` and `J(π/4)² = 0` (Lightlike Nilpotent Horizon),
     - `θ = π/2`: `J(π/2) = Φ` and `J(π/2)² = +V` (Spacelike).

