/-! ===========================================================================
    Section 7: Two-Sheeted Klein Bottle Seam, Sum/Difference Sheet Connections
    (`∇₊ ± ∇₋`), Single-Sheet Blindness on Throat Operators, Klein Four-Group
    Characters (`χ₊₊, χ₊₋, χ₋₊, χ₋₋`), Curvature Asymmetry (`∇₊² - ∇₋²`), &
